<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>FitGuide — Modern Fitness, Anatomy & Nutrition Educational Platform</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Beginner-friendly fitness and nutrition platform to explore exercises, anatomical body parts, benefits, risks, and macronutrient/micronutrient guides.">
  
  <!-- Google Fonts: Inter & Outfit -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Outfit:wght@500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  
  <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      darkMode: ['class', '[data-theme="dark"]'],
      theme: {
        extend: {
          colors: {
            brand: {
              dark: '#090e1a',
              card: '#151f38',
              emerald: '#10b981',
              orange: '#f97316',
              blue: '#38bdf8'
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  </script>

  <!-- Custom Stylesheet -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/styles.css">
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col">

  <!-- Persistent Health Disclaimer Banner -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-950/70 via-slate-900 to-amber-950/70 border-b border-slate-700/60 text-slate-300 text-xs py-2 px-4 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
      <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">Disclaimer:</span>
      <span>FitGuide provides general educational fitness & nutrition information. Recommendations vary between individuals and do not replace professional medical or dietary consultation.</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Navigation Header -->
  <header class="glass-nav sticky top-0 z-50 transition-colors">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between h-16">
        
        <!-- Logo -->
        <a href="#home" data-nav-target="home" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 group">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-emerald-500 to-teal-400 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-950 font-black text-xl shadow-md group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
            ⚡
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="text-xl font-black font-heading tracking-tight text-white flex items-center">
              Fit<span class="text-emerald-400">Guide</span>
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 -mt-1 block uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">Learn & Train</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Desktop Navigation Links -->
        <nav class="hidden lg:flex items-center space-x-1 xl:space-x-1.5 text-xs font-medium">
          <a href="#home" data-nav-target="home" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-md transition-colors text-slate-300 hover:text-white">Home</a>
          <a href="#exercises" data-nav-target="exercises" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-md transition-colors text-slate-300 hover:text-white">Exercises</a>
          <a href="#bodyparts" data-nav-target="bodyparts" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-md transition-colors text-slate-300 hover:text-white">Interactive Body</a>
          <a href="#height" data-nav-target="height" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-md transition-colors text-teal-400 font-bold hover:text-teal-300 flex items-center gap-1">
            <span>📏</span> Height
          </a>
          <a href="#women" data-nav-target="women" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-md transition-colors text-pink-400 font-bold hover:text-pink-300 flex items-center gap-1" title="Mature Cycle, Hormones & Pregnancy Care">
            <span>🌸</span> Women's Health
          </a>
          <a href="#diseases" data-nav-target="diseases" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-md transition-colors text-amber-400 font-bold hover:text-amber-300 flex items-center gap-1" title="Diseases, Dietary Cures & Medicines">
            <span>🩺</span> Disease Cures
          </a>
          <a href="#diet" data-nav-target="diet" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-md transition-colors text-emerald-400 font-bold hover:text-emerald-300 flex items-center gap-1" title="Balanced Daily Diet Plans for Men & Women">
            <span>🥗</span> Healthy Diets
          </a>
          <a href="#nutrition" data-nav-target="nutrition" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-md transition-colors text-slate-300 hover:text-white">Nutrition</a>
          <a href="#foods" data-nav-target="foods" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-md transition-colors text-slate-300 hover:text-white">Foods</a>
          <a href="#calculator" data-nav-target="calculator" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-md transition-colors text-slate-300 hover:text-white">Calculator</a>
          <a href="#tracker" data-nav-target="tracker" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-md transition-colors text-slate-300 hover:text-white">Tracker</a>
          <a href="#gyms" data-nav-target="gyms" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-md transition-colors text-emerald-400 font-bold hover:text-emerald-300 flex items-center gap-1">
            <span>📍</span> Gyms
          </a>
        </nav>

        <!-- Right Header Actions -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-2.5">
          <!-- FitBot AI Header Button -->
          <button id="header-fitbot-btn" onclick="toggleFitBot()" class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 sm:px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-purple-500/50 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500/20 via-indigo-500/20 to-teal-500/20 text-purple-300 hover:text-white text-xs font-bold hover:from-purple-500/30 hover:to-teal-500/30 transition-all cursor-pointer shadow-sm" title="Chat with FitBot AI Coach">
            <span class="animate-pulse">🤖</span> <span class="hidden sm:inline">FitBot AI</span>
          </button>

          <!-- QR Login & Share Button -->
          <button id="qr-login-btn" onclick="openQrModal()" class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 sm:px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-teal-500/50 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500/20 to-teal-500/20 text-emerald-300 hover:text-white text-xs font-bold hover:from-emerald-500/30 hover:to-teal-500/30 transition-all cursor-pointer shadow-sm" title="Scan QR Code to Login or Share Link with Relatives">
            <span>📱</span> <span class="hidden sm:inline" id="header-user-status">QR Login & Share</span>
          </button>

          <!-- WhatsApp Quick Chat Button -->
          <a href="https://wa.me/919014430474?text=Hi%20FitGuide%2C%20I%20have%20a%20fitness%20and%20nutrition%20question!" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="hidden sm:inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/40 bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold hover:bg-emerald-500/25 transition-all" title="WhatsApp: +91 9014430474">
            <span>💬</span> <span class="hidden md:inline">WhatsApp</span>
          </a>

          <!-- Gmail Direct Mail Button -->
          <a href="mailto:venkateshvemula8897@gmail.com?subject=FitGuide%20Fitness%20%26%20Nutrition%20Inquiry"
            class="hidden sm:inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 text-xs font-medium hover:border-slate-500 hover:text-white transition-all" title="Email: venkateshvemula8897@gmail.com">
            <span>✉️</span> <span class="hidden md:inline">Gmail</span>
          </a>

          <!-- Global Search trigger button -->
          <button onclick="openModal('global-search-modal')" class="hidden sm:flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 text-xs text-slate-300 hover:border-emerald-500 hover:text-white transition-all cursor-pointer" title="Quick Search (Ctrl+K)">
            <span>🔍 Search...</span>
            <kbd class="hidden xl:inline-block px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-mono bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded text-slate-400">Ctrl+K</kbd>
          </button>

          <!-- Favorites Drawer Button -->
          <button id="open-favorites-btn" class="relative p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-200 hover:text-white hover:border-slate-600 transition-all cursor-pointer" title="Saved Favorites">
            <span>❤️</span>
            <span id="fav-count-badge" style="display:none;" class="absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-slate-950 font-black text-[10px] items-center justify-center">0</span>
          </button>

          <!-- Dark/Light Theme Toggle -->
          <button id="theme-toggle-btn" class="p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-200 hover:text-white hover:border-slate-600 transition-all cursor-pointer" title="Toggle Theme">
            <span id="theme-icon">☀️</span>
          </button>

          <!-- Mobile Hamburger Toggle -->
          <button id="mobile-menu-btn" class="lg:hidden p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-200 hover:text-white transition-all">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"/></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Mobile Navigation Drawer Menu -->
    <div id="mobile-nav-menu" class="hidden lg:hidden border-b border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/95 px-4 pt-2 pb-4 space-y-1 text-sm font-medium">
      <button onclick="toggleFitBot(); document.getElementById('mobile-nav-menu')?.classList.add('hidden');" class="w-full text-left flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500/20 to-indigo-500/20 border border-purple-500/40 text-purple-300 font-bold text-xs hover:bg-purple-500/25 mb-1 cursor-pointer">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span>🤖</span> <span>FitBot AI 24/7 Smart Health Coach</span></span>
        <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-purple-500/30 text-[10px] text-purple-200">Active</span>
      </button>
      <button onclick="openQrModal()" class="w-full text-left flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500/20 to-teal-500/20 border border-teal-500/40 text-teal-300 font-bold text-xs hover:bg-teal-500/25 mb-1 cursor-pointer">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span>📱</span> <span>QR Code Login & Share with Relatives</span></span>
        <span>➔</span>
      </button>
      <a href="#home" data-nav-target="home" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-800">Home</a>
      <a href="#women" data-nav-target="women" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-pink-400 font-bold hover:bg-slate-800">🌸 Women's Health (Mature Cycle & Pregnancy)</a>
      <a href="#diseases" data-nav-target="diseases" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-amber-400 font-bold hover:bg-slate-800">🩺 Disease Cures & Dietary Treatments (Men & Women)</a>
      <a href="#diet" data-nav-target="diet" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-emerald-400 font-bold hover:bg-slate-800">🥗 Healthy Balanced Daily Diets (Both Genders)</a>
      <a href="#height" data-nav-target="height" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-teal-400 font-bold hover:bg-slate-800">📏 Height & Growth Guide</a>
      <a href="#exercises" data-nav-target="exercises" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-800">Exercises</a>
      <a href="#bodyparts" data-nav-target="bodyparts" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-800">Interactive Body</a>
      <a href="#nutrition" data-nav-target="nutrition" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-800">Nutrition Guide</a>
      <a href="#foods" data-nav-target="foods" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-800">Food Database</a>
      <a href="#calculator" data-nav-target="calculator" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-800">Daily Calculator</a>
      <a href="#tracker" data-nav-target="tracker" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-800">Daily Tracker & Workouts</a>
      <a href="#gyms" data-nav-target="gyms" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-emerald-400 font-bold hover:bg-slate-800">📍 Find Fitness Gyms (Gajuwaka & Vizag)</a>
      <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-800 flex gap-2">
        <a href="https://wa.me/919014430474?text=Hi%20FitGuide%2C%20I%20have%20a%20fitness%20and%20nutrition%20question!" target="_blank" class="w-1/2 text-center py-2 bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold">
          💬 WhatsApp
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:venkateshvemula8897@gmail.com?subject=FitGuide%20Fitness%20Inquiry" class="w-1/2 text-center py-2 bg-slate-800 text-slate-200 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold">
          ✉️ Gmail
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- =========================================================================
       SECTION 1: HOME PAGE
       ========================================================================= -->
  <section id="section-home" class="app-section active">
    <!-- Hero Banner -->
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden py-16 sm:py-24 border-b border-slate-800">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20 pointer-events-none bg-[radial-gradient(#10b981_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:24px_24px]"></div>
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center relative z-10">
        
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-semibold mb-6">
          <span>✨</span> Beginner-Friendly Fitness & Nutrition Intelligence
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-black font-heading tracking-tight text-white mb-6">
          Train Smart. <span class="text-gradient-emerald">Eat Better.</span> <br class="hidden sm:inline">Live Stronger.
        </h1>

        <p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 mb-10 leading-relaxed">
          Master exercise execution, understand your body anatomy, discover recovery-boosting foods, and calculate your scientific nutritional requirements without extreme diets.
        </p>

        <!-- Home Global Search Bar -->
        <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto relative mb-8">
          <div class="relative">
            <input type="text" id="home-search-input" placeholder="Search an exercise (e.g. push-ups, squats) or food (e.g. paneer, dal, iron)..."
              class="w-full pl-12 pr-4 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 text-white placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500/20 shadow-lg text-sm">
            <span class="absolute left-4 top-4 text-slate-400 text-lg">🔍</span>
          </div>
          <div id="home-search-results" class="search-results-floating hidden text-left"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- Call to Action Buttons -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 mb-12">
          <a href="#exercises" data-nav-target="exercises" class="btn-primary text-sm py-3 px-6 rounded-xl">
            Explore Exercises ➔
          </a>
          <a href="#nutrition" data-nav-target="nutrition" class="btn-secondary text-sm py-3 px-6 rounded-xl">
            Explore Nutrition 🥑
          </a>
          <a href="#calculator" data-nav-target="calculator" class="btn-orange text-sm py-3 px-6 rounded-xl">
            Calculate Daily Macros 📊
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- FitBot AI Quick Coach Banner -->
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-950/60 via-slate-900 to-indigo-950/60 border border-purple-500/40 shadow-xl flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-purple-500/20 border border-purple-500/40 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shrink-0 shadow-inner">
              🤖
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-0.5">
                <span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-300 border border-purple-500/30">
                  NEW • 24/7 AI COACH
                </span>
                <span class="text-xs text-emerald-400 font-bold flex items-center gap-1">
                  <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span> Online
                </span>
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-extrabold text-white">Have fitness, cycle, pregnancy, or disease diet questions?</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-0.5">Ask FitBot AI anytime for evidence-based workouts, clinical dietary precautions & medicines.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <button onclick="openFitBot()" class="shrink-0 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-purple-500 hover:to-indigo-500 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow-lg hover:shadow-purple-500/30 transition-all flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap">
            <span>Ask FitBot AI</span>
            <span>➔</span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Category Pills -->
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
          <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold text-slate-400 block mb-3">Quick Explore by Muscle & Nutrient:</span>
          <div id="home-category-pills" class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Core Pillars Feature Cards (Clickable Navigation) -->
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <!-- 1. Form & Exercise Library -->
        <div class="fit-card p-6 cursor-pointer hover:border-emerald-500/80 hover:shadow-glow transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group rounded-2xl bg-slate-850" onclick="navigateToTab('exercises')" data-nav-target="exercises" role="button" tabindex="0">
          <div>
            <div class="text-4xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">🏋️‍♂️</div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors mb-2">Form & Exercise Library</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Step-by-step instructions, benefits, risks, common mistakes, and suitable equipment alternatives.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-3 border-t border-slate-700/60 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400">
            <span>Open Exercise Library</span>
            <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">➔</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. Interactive Body Map -->
        <div class="fit-card p-6 cursor-pointer hover:border-emerald-500/80 hover:shadow-glow transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group rounded-2xl bg-slate-850" onclick="navigateToTab('bodyparts')" data-nav-target="bodyparts" role="button" tabindex="0">
          <div>
            <div class="text-4xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">🧬</div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors mb-2">Interactive Body Map</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Select any muscle on our anatomical human model to reveal exercises that target that specific area.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-3 border-t border-slate-700/60 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400">
            <span>Open Interactive Map</span>
            <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">➔</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. Macro & Food Database -->
        <div class="fit-card p-6 cursor-pointer hover:border-emerald-500/80 hover:shadow-glow transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group rounded-2xl bg-slate-850" onclick="navigateToTab('foods')" data-nav-target="foods" role="button" tabindex="0">
          <div>
            <div class="text-4xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">🥗</div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors mb-2">Macro & Food Database</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Rich nutrition data with Indian staples (Dal, Paneer, Chana, Ragi) and global lean recovery foods.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-3 border-t border-slate-700/60 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400">
            <span>Browse Food Database</span>
            <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">➔</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. Daily Progress Tracker -->
        <div class="fit-card p-6 cursor-pointer hover:border-emerald-500/80 hover:shadow-glow transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group rounded-2xl bg-slate-850" onclick="navigateToTab('tracker')" data-nav-target="tracker" role="button" tabindex="0">
          <div>
            <div class="text-4xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">📈</div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors mb-2">Daily Progress Tracker</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Track daily protein goals, hydration glasses, and custom workout check-lists locally and securely.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-3 border-t border-slate-700/60 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400">
            <span>Open Habits Tracker</span>
            <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">➔</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Local Gyms & Direct WhatsApp Banner -->
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-12">
      <div class="fit-card p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-950/60 via-slate-900 to-blue-950/60 border border-emerald-500/40 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-500/20 border border-emerald-500/40 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl">
            📍
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/40">
                Sheelanagar, Gajuwaka & Visakhapatnam Centers
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs text-amber-400 font-bold">★ 4.8+ Rated Gyms</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-white">Find Fitness Gyms Near You on Google Maps</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-1 max-w-xl">
              Locate gyms across Sheelanagar (U Fit Fitness, Pulse Hub), Gajuwaka (Steel Plant, Cult.fit) & Vizag (Gold's Gym) with ratings, equipment info, live GPS, and direct WhatsApp inquiries.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 w-full md:w-auto">
          <button onclick="navigateToTab('gyms')" class="btn-primary text-xs py-3 px-5 rounded-xl whitespace-nowrap w-full sm:w-auto justify-center">
