            <span class="font-bold text-red-400 block mb-1">🥤 Carbonated Colas & Soft Drinks</span>
            <p class="text-slate-300">High phosphoric acid directly binds to dietary calcium and leaches stored calcium right out of your bones into urine.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-800/80 rounded-xl border border-red-900/40">
            <span class="font-bold text-red-400 block mb-1">🍬 High-Sugar Junk & Late Snacking</span>
            <p class="text-slate-300">Causes acute blood sugar and insulin spikes. Elevated insulin directly shuts down nighttime pituitary Human Growth Hormone (HGH) release.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-800/80 rounded-xl border border-red-900/40">
            <span class="font-bold text-red-400 block mb-1">📱 Late-Night Blue Light & Poor Sleep</span>
            <p class="text-slate-300">Scrolling past 11:00 PM blocks melatonin and skips the Stage 3-4 deep sleep window where 75% of daily growth hormone is released.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-800/80 rounded-xl border border-red-900/40">
            <span class="font-bold text-red-400 block mb-1">🛋️ Chronic Slouching ('Text Neck')</span>
            <p class="text-slate-300">Holding head forward compresses cervical discs under 50+ lbs of pressure, shortening the spinal column by 1 to 2 inches.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-800/80 rounded-xl border border-red-900/40">
            <span class="font-bold text-red-400 block mb-1">🚬 Smoking & Excessive Caffeine</span>
            <p class="text-slate-300">Constricts micro-capillaries supplying blood to bone growth plates and inhibits osteoblast bone remodeling.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-800/80 rounded-xl border border-teal-900/40 bg-teal-950/20">
            <span class="font-bold text-teal-400 block mb-1">💡 The Golden Rule: 8-10 Hours Sleep</span>
            <p class="text-slate-300">Go to bed between 9:30 PM - 10:30 PM in a cool, dark room. Natural HGH pulses highest between 10:00 PM and 2:00 AM.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
